[
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.350",
    "end": "00:00:26.250",
    "start_seconds": 18.35,
    "end_seconds": 26.25,
    "text": "-Each year Toastmasters International conducts the Video Speech Contest designed specifically"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.250",
    "end": "00:00:29.369",
    "start_seconds": 26.25,
    "end_seconds": 29.369,
    "text": "for members of undistricted clubs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.369",
    "end": "00:00:39.350",
    "start_seconds": 29.369,
    "end_seconds": 39.35,
    "text": "Clubs that participate, conduct a speech contest, and submit a video of their 1st place winner"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.350",
    "end": "00:00:44.090",
    "start_seconds": 39.35,
    "end_seconds": 44.09,
    "text": "to be judged by a panel of Toastmasters members."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.090",
    "end": "00:00:50.060",
    "start_seconds": 44.09,
    "end_seconds": 50.06,
    "text": "I am pleased to share with you the 1st place winner of the 2020-2021 Video Speech Contest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.060",
    "end": "00:00:55.720",
    "start_seconds": 50.06,
    "end_seconds": 55.72,
    "text": "-Our first speaker for tonight, Roderick Grech, with his speech, Want It."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.720",
    "end": "00:00:57.610",
    "start_seconds": 55.72,
    "end_seconds": 57.61,
    "text": "Want It, Roderick Grech."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.610",
    "end": "00:00:59.500",
    "start_seconds": 57.61,
    "end_seconds": 59.5,
    "text": "The stage is yours."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.500",
    "end": "00:01:11.479",
    "start_seconds": 59.5,
    "end_seconds": 71.479,
    "text": "Where there is a will, there is a way, but do you know what it means or how to find the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.479",
    "end": "00:01:18.340",
    "start_seconds": 71.479,
    "end_seconds": 78.34,
    "text": "will that finds you the way?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.340",
    "end": "00:01:22.680",
    "start_seconds": 78.34,
    "end_seconds": 82.68,
    "text": "That's about what-what you can pick up in the next five minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.680",
    "end": "00:01:24.930",
    "start_seconds": 82.68,
    "end_seconds": 84.93,
    "text": "contest your toastmaster, welcome guests."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.930",
    "end": "00:01:31.310",
    "start_seconds": 84.93,
    "end_seconds": 91.31,
    "text": "Let's sketch a picture; in secondary school I wasn't exactly your exemplary student."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.310",
    "end": "00:01:32.310",
    "start_seconds": 91.31,
    "end_seconds": 92.31,
    "text": "My sister?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.310",
    "end": "00:01:35.450",
    "start_seconds": 92.31,
    "end_seconds": 95.45,
    "text": "Serial prize winner, year-in, year-out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.450",
    "end": "00:01:38.590",
    "start_seconds": 95.45,
    "end_seconds": 98.59,
    "text": "I on the other hand was also a prize winner…for the lowest mark in all the school."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:38.590",
    "end": "00:01:44.210",
    "start_seconds": 98.59,
    "end_seconds": 104.21000000000001,
    "text": "The education system and teaching methods didn't quite appeal to me, so I refused to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.210",
    "end": "00:01:51.770",
    "start_seconds": 104.21000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 111.77000000000001,
    "text": "have anything to do with it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.770",
    "end": "00:02:00.479",
    "start_seconds": 111.77000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 120.479,
    "text": "But this was 1985 and the clock had already started running six months to the old levels"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.479",
    "end": "00:02:05.039",
    "start_seconds": 120.479,
    "end_seconds": 125.039,
    "text": "that would determine the rest of my future."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.039",
    "end": "00:02:10.009",
    "start_seconds": 125.039,
    "end_seconds": 130.00900000000001,
    "text": "Of course, the writing was on the wall."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.009",
    "end": "00:02:14.570",
    "start_seconds": 130.00900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 134.57,
    "text": "I was crashing out of one of the best schools as a failure."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.570",
    "end": "00:02:22.000",
    "start_seconds": 134.57,
    "end_seconds": 142.0,
    "text": "I had crushed our biggest source of our mother's pride: a successful son."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.000",
    "end": "00:02:28.330",
    "start_seconds": 142.0,
    "end_seconds": 148.32999999999998,
    "text": "In my catalogue of regrets that sticks out like a sore thumb."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.330",
    "end": "00:02:33.520",
    "start_seconds": 148.32999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 153.52,
    "text": "My dad on the other hand sounded cooler about it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.520",
    "end": "00:02:38.610",
    "start_seconds": 153.52,
    "end_seconds": 158.61,
    "text": "For one December Sunday morning he walks to my room, “Son, there's a storm brewing next"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.610",
    "end": "00:02:42.900",
    "start_seconds": 158.61,
    "end_seconds": 162.9,
    "text": "week, will you help-come to help me pull the boat up?”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.900",
    "end": "00:02:49.650",
    "start_seconds": 162.9,
    "end_seconds": 169.65,
    "text": "Were it not the calm before the storm, it's so easy to have thought it was summer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.650",
    "end": "00:02:58.120",
    "start_seconds": 169.65,
    "end_seconds": 178.12,
    "text": "That warm December Sunday morning as we stood in hip-deep water with the sun shining overhead"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.120",
    "end": "00:03:09.160",
    "start_seconds": 178.12,
    "end_seconds": 189.16,
    "text": "as what we're seeing proceeded, Dad turns to me and says, “Son, relax."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.160",
    "end": "00:03:12.930",
    "start_seconds": 189.16,
    "end_seconds": 192.93,
    "text": "Take a deep breath.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.930",
    "end": "00:03:19.150",
    "start_seconds": 192.93,
    "end_seconds": 199.15,
    "text": "And then he gently pushes my head into the water."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.150",
    "end": "00:03:22.100",
    "start_seconds": 199.15,
    "end_seconds": 202.1,
    "text": "He keeps my head submerged."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.100",
    "end": "00:03:30.950",
    "start_seconds": 202.1,
    "end_seconds": 210.95,
    "text": "When he senses I'm starting to feel uncomfortable, he counts five more seconds, then, “What"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.950",
    "end": "00:03:35.300",
    "start_seconds": 210.95,
    "end_seconds": 215.3,
    "text": "was it that you wanted most when your face was in the water?”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.300",
    "end": "00:03:37.350",
    "start_seconds": 215.3,
    "end_seconds": 217.35,
    "text": "“What do you mean, Dad?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.350",
    "end": "00:03:38.580",
    "start_seconds": 217.35,
    "end_seconds": 218.57999999999998,
    "text": "Air to breathe!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.580",
    "end": "00:03:40.220",
    "start_seconds": 218.57999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 220.22,
    "text": "What do you mean?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.220",
    "end": "00:03:41.220",
    "start_seconds": 220.22,
    "end_seconds": 221.22,
    "text": "Come on.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.220",
    "end": "00:03:51.560",
    "start_seconds": 221.22,
    "end_seconds": 231.56,
    "text": "“Son, if you want your life to be a success, want it like the air you wanted to breathe"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.560",
    "end": "00:03:54.050",
    "start_seconds": 231.56,
    "end_seconds": 234.05,
    "text": "when your face was in the water."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.050",
    "end": "00:03:56.110",
    "start_seconds": 234.05,
    "end_seconds": 236.11,
    "text": "Want it, that you forget to eat drink and sleep."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.110",
    "end": "00:04:03.920",
    "start_seconds": 236.11,
    "end_seconds": 243.92,
    "text": "Want it as if it's life-threatening, as if you'd rather die than live without it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.920",
    "end": "00:04:10.710",
    "start_seconds": 243.92,
    "end_seconds": 250.71,
    "text": "Want it, because otherwise your life, you might be wasting your life.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.710",
    "end": "00:04:18.259",
    "start_seconds": 250.71,
    "end_seconds": 258.259,
    "text": "What on earth would you have felt if you were instead of me?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.259",
    "end": "00:04:25.539",
    "start_seconds": 258.259,
    "end_seconds": 265.539,
    "text": "My reaction: ‘this moment of insanity, it will pass.’"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.539",
    "end": "00:04:27.960",
    "start_seconds": 265.539,
    "end_seconds": 267.96,
    "text": "That was me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.960",
    "end": "00:04:35.650",
    "start_seconds": 267.96,
    "end_seconds": 275.65,
    "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, that was my final warning, and I didn't even see it coming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.650",
    "end": "00:04:40.310",
    "start_seconds": 275.65,
    "end_seconds": 280.31,
    "text": "Can you see how easy it is to become addicted to inaction?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.310",
    "end": "00:04:43.370",
    "start_seconds": 280.31,
    "end_seconds": 283.37,
    "text": "That is the result of wishing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.370",
    "end": "00:04:54.910",
    "start_seconds": 283.37,
    "end_seconds": 294.90999999999997,
    "text": "I had many wishes for success, architect, engineer pilot, but I had shot them all down"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.910",
    "end": "00:04:56.430",
    "start_seconds": 294.90999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 296.43,
    "text": "one by one."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.430",
    "end": "00:05:01.490",
    "start_seconds": 296.43,
    "end_seconds": 301.49,
    "text": "Not by doing something wrong, but simply by doing nothing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.490",
    "end": "00:05:02.490",
    "start_seconds": 301.49,
    "end_seconds": 302.49,
    "text": "Inaction."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.490",
    "end": "00:05:05.530",
    "start_seconds": 302.49,
    "end_seconds": 305.53,
    "text": "Neither creating nor destroying; letting be, inaction."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.530",
    "end": "00:05:08.570",
    "start_seconds": 305.53,
    "end_seconds": 308.57,
    "text": "That is the result of wishing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.570",
    "end": "00:05:12.610",
    "start_seconds": 308.57,
    "end_seconds": 312.61,
    "text": "The following month, January 1986, something bizarre happened."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.610",
    "end": "00:05:22.380",
    "start_seconds": 312.61,
    "end_seconds": 322.38,
    "text": "We were at school during lunch break, and I saw all my classmates eagerly swarming around"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.380",
    "end": "00:05:31.691",
    "start_seconds": 322.38,
    "end_seconds": 331.691,
    "text": "our physics teacher, a short, young, 25-year-old fresh graduate from University, which was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.691",
    "end": "00:05:32.691",
    "start_seconds": 331.691,
    "end_seconds": 332.69100000000003,
    "text": "rather unusual."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.691",
    "end": "00:05:43.030",
    "start_seconds": 332.69100000000003,
    "end_seconds": 343.03,
    "text": "As I moved closer, I heard that he was telling us eager 15-year-old boys how to win a date"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:43.030",
    "end": "00:05:44.910",
    "start_seconds": 343.03,
    "end_seconds": 344.90999999999997,
    "text": "with a girl."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.910",
    "end": "00:05:48.030",
    "start_seconds": 344.90999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 348.03,
    "text": "What he said stunned me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.030",
    "end": "00:05:57.110",
    "start_seconds": 348.03,
    "end_seconds": 357.11,
    "text": "Rightly or wrongly, he claimed that the top criteria a girl uses to decide whether to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:57.110",
    "end": "00:06:00.690",
    "start_seconds": 357.11,
    "end_seconds": 360.69,
    "text": "accept a date with a boy is his academic results."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.690",
    "end": "00:06:06.660",
    "start_seconds": 360.69,
    "end_seconds": 366.66,
    "text": "No one around me noticed, but if you were inside of me, you had to have felt a crushing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.660",
    "end": "00:06:08.220",
    "start_seconds": 366.66,
    "end_seconds": 368.22,
    "text": "blow of disappointment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.220",
    "end": "00:06:11.880",
    "start_seconds": 368.22,
    "end_seconds": 371.88,
    "text": "I had nothing to show in that department."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:11.880",
    "end": "00:06:13.520",
    "start_seconds": 371.88,
    "end_seconds": 373.52,
    "text": "My desperation became my inspiration."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.520",
    "end": "00:06:16.900",
    "start_seconds": 373.52,
    "end_seconds": 376.9,
    "text": "I asked my sister, my friends for notes, tried to cram into my head even what I couldn't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.900",
    "end": "00:06:17.900",
    "start_seconds": 376.9,
    "end_seconds": 377.9,
    "text": "understand."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.900",
    "end": "00:06:21.050",
    "start_seconds": 377.9,
    "end_seconds": 381.05,
    "text": "I'll never forget the sight of my mother walking down to the kitchen at three o'clock in the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.050",
    "end": "00:06:31.450",
    "start_seconds": 381.05,
    "end_seconds": 391.45,
    "text": "morning where I used to study, wondering what's gotten into me, with my dinner there is still"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.450",
    "end": "00:06:36.130",
    "start_seconds": 391.45,
    "end_seconds": 396.13,
    "text": "uneaten, such that I would eat it for breakfast."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:36.130",
    "end": "00:06:47.510",
    "start_seconds": 396.13,
    "end_seconds": 407.51,
    "text": "Hey, hey, hey, could that be what my dad meant when he said want it that you forget to eat"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:47.510",
    "end": "00:06:49.550",
    "start_seconds": 407.51,
    "end_seconds": 409.55,
    "text": "drink and sleep?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.550",
    "end": "00:06:52.270",
    "start_seconds": 409.55,
    "end_seconds": 412.27,
    "text": "I understood him then."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.270",
    "end": "00:06:54.501",
    "start_seconds": 412.27,
    "end_seconds": 414.501,
    "text": "Make no mistake, I made it to sixth form by the skin of my teeth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.501",
    "end": "00:06:55.501",
    "start_seconds": 414.501,
    "end_seconds": 415.501,
    "text": "But that experience, the stress, the pressure, it taught me one thing: that you can want"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.501",
    "end": "00:06:56.501",
    "start_seconds": 415.501,
    "end_seconds": 416.501,
    "text": "whatever you wish, and it will make a hell of a difference."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.501",
    "end": "00:06:57.880",
    "start_seconds": 416.501,
    "end_seconds": 417.88,
    "text": "What is it that you might be currently wishing as we speak?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.880",
    "end": "00:06:59.630",
    "start_seconds": 417.88,
    "end_seconds": 419.63,
    "text": "Perhaps losing weight, a promotion, or earning the respect of your boss."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.630",
    "end": "00:07:01.180",
    "start_seconds": 419.63,
    "end_seconds": 421.18,
    "text": "How about wanting it like I wanted a date when I was 15?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:01.180",
    "end": "00:07:03.147",
    "start_seconds": 421.18,
    "end_seconds": 423.147,
    "text": "Here's how you can do it in three steps: 1, want it as if your life depends on it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.147",
    "end": "00:07:07.580",
    "start_seconds": 423.147,
    "end_seconds": 427.58,
    "text": "In my case, winning a date at 15 years of age meant the world to me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.580",
    "end": "00:07:11.580",
    "start_seconds": 427.58,
    "end_seconds": 431.58,
    "text": "Want it as if you'd rather die than live without it, want it like the air you want to breathe"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.580",
    "end": "00:07:13.680",
    "start_seconds": 431.58,
    "end_seconds": 433.68,
    "text": "when you're out of breath."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.680",
    "end": "00:07:15.780",
    "start_seconds": 433.68,
    "end_seconds": 435.78,
    "text": "2, become obsessed about it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:15.780",
    "end": "00:07:19.760",
    "start_seconds": 435.78,
    "end_seconds": 439.76,
    "text": "You know you want something when you think about it every minute of every day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.760",
    "end": "00:07:22.741",
    "start_seconds": 439.76,
    "end_seconds": 442.741,
    "text": "Whilst you’re shaving, doing your makeup, driving, while you’re stuck in traffic,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:22.741",
    "end": "00:07:23.741",
    "start_seconds": 442.741,
    "end_seconds": 443.741,
    "text": "waiting for an elevator, waiting for a meeting to start…instead of you chasing your dream,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.741",
    "end": "00:07:24.741",
    "start_seconds": 443.741,
    "end_seconds": 444.741,
    "text": "your dream chases you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.741",
    "end": "00:07:25.741",
    "start_seconds": 444.741,
    "end_seconds": 445.741,
    "text": "If wanting something could change a school failure like me to gra-qualify as a professional,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:25.741",
    "end": "00:07:26.741",
    "start_seconds": 445.741,
    "end_seconds": 446.741,
    "text": "get an MBA, become a pilot, open my own business, then what can wanting do to you?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.741",
    "end": "00:07:27.990",
    "start_seconds": 446.741,
    "end_seconds": 447.99,
    "text": "And finally, um, it's okay to have a wish list, but not a want list."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:27.990",
    "end": "00:07:31.190",
    "start_seconds": 447.99,
    "end_seconds": 451.19,
    "text": "Want only one thing but want it with all your heart and all your soul, because when you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.190",
    "end": "00:07:33.340",
    "start_seconds": 451.19,
    "end_seconds": 453.34000000000003,
    "text": "find yourself wanting everything, that's a sure sign that you're dangerously close to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.340",
    "end": "00:07:34.340",
    "start_seconds": 453.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 454.34000000000003,
    "text": "really wanting nothing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:34.340",
    "end": "00:07:36.389",
    "start_seconds": 454.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 456.389,
    "text": "And finally on a light-hearted note, for the educators who might be listening to this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:36.389",
    "end": "00:07:39.300",
    "start_seconds": 456.389,
    "end_seconds": 459.3,
    "text": "if teaching teenage boys how to win a date with a girl is not on the curriculum, it should"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.300",
    "end": "00:07:40.300",
    "start_seconds": 459.3,
    "end_seconds": 460.3,
    "text": "be."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:40.300",
    "end": "00:07:41.300",
    "start_seconds": 460.3,
    "end_seconds": 461.3,
    "text": "It will get them interested."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.300",
    "end": "00:07:45.699",
    "start_seconds": 461.3,
    "end_seconds": 465.699,
    "text": "Friends, ladies and gentlemen, remember this: don’t wish it, just want it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.699",
    "end": "00:07:46.990",
    "start_seconds": 465.699,
    "end_seconds": 466.99,
    "text": "Contest Chair."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:46.990",
    "end": "00:07:47.630",
    "start_seconds": 466.99,
    "end_seconds": 467.63,
    "text": "[Applause]"
  }
]
